WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.456
For centuries, the enigmatic truth behind Every night, a lonely boy wished he could stop time.

2
00:00:06.456 --> 00:00:09.480
One day, his wish came true.

3
00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:14.856
He could freeze everything around him, the rain, the wind, even people.

4
00:00:14.856 --> 00:00:17.904
At first, he felt like a god.

5
00:00:17.904 --> 00:00:23.304
He used his power to win fights, avoid pain, and escape every problem.

6
00:00:23.304 --> 00:00:27.000
But slowly, he noticed something terrifying.

7
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.800
Every time he stopped time, someone he loved forgot a memory of him.

8
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:35.496
First, his best friend forgot their childhood.

9
00:00:35.496 --> 00:00:38.544
Then, his mother forgot his name.

10
00:00:38.544 --> 00:00:43.896
Desperate, he stopped time one final time and whispered, I want to stay with you.
